# Some generated blocks concatenate several fixed sentences into one text node,
# or split a sentence around an inline link/code element.  These replacements
# are deliberately narrow report phrases; they never include task names,
# reference answers, or provider output.
PHRASES = {
    "；不得返回安全验证或拒绝访问页": "; must not return a security-verification or access-denied page",
    "高。核验时隐藏机器结论和分数，只提供任务契约、标准答案与完整实际输出；分歧回到原始证据裁定，未决非零则禁止发布。任务和输出未变化时沿用原核验；发生变化的调用必须重新盲审。": "high. Machine verdicts and scores are hidden during review; only the task contract, reference answer, and complete actual output are provided. Disagreements are adjudicated from original evidence, and any unresolved item blocks publication. Existing reviews are retained when task and output are unchanged; changed calls require a new blind review.",
    "Codex 独立强推理代理": "Codex independent high-reasoning agent",
    "任务运行时默认模型": "the task runtime's default model",
    "；推理强度：高。": "; reasoning effort: high.",
    "关键事实按规范化后的可见文本机械匹配：统一 Unicode、大小写及排版空白，菜单路径如 Settings": "Key facts are matched mechanically against normalized visible text: Unicode, letter case, and layout whitespace are normalized, so menu paths such as Settings",
    "AI 与 Settings": "AI and Settings",
    "AI 等价；忽略 Markdown 链接地址、行内代码与加粗标记。一个已被完整记录边界约束的字段允许丢失内联元素间空白，例如标签列表": "AI are equivalent; Markdown link destinations, inline-code markers, and emphasis markers are ignored. A field whose complete record boundary is known may omit whitespace between inline elements, such as the tag list",
    "有参考时，请求失败计 0；请求成功但任务未通过仍按实际正文评分。": "With a complete reference, request failures score 0; successful requests that fail task acceptance are still scored using their actual body text.",
    "文字核对覆盖只衡量各例登记的必需文字组，不等于全文完整度；没有文字核对依据的案例不进入该项均值。": "Required-text coverage measures only registered required-text groups; it is not full-text recall. Tasks without text evidence are excluded from that average.",
    "判分完整性是已有明确判定的调用数/计划调用数，不是通过率；任何方法未满即表示整份报告不完整，禁止发布。": "Judgement coverage is judged calls divided by planned calls, not a pass rate. If any method is incomplete, the entire report is incomplete and publication is blocked.",
    "均值、P50、P95 仅统计各方法自身通过项，不能直接视为同题速度排名。": "Mean, P50, and P95 include only each method's own passing calls and are not a matched-task speed ranking.",
    "各类型按各自任务范围比较，不合并为跨类型总分。": "Each family is compared within its own task scope and is not combined into a cross-family weighted score.",
    "含有已排除易变字段的旧快照文字分仅保留在调用详情，不进入本表全文均值。": "Legacy snapshot-text scores containing excluded volatile fields remain in attempt details and are excluded from this table's full-text averages.",
    "列表、固定字段标签与说明共同验收；标题文字质量仅作下方辅助诊断。": "Lists, stable field labels, and descriptions are judged together; title-text quality is only a supporting diagnostic below.",
    "直接文件必须有字节验收才能判分；任何缺失都会使整份报告标为不可靠。资源、文件、信息三列分别按对应任务计算。": "Direct-file tasks require byte validation. Any missing evidence makes the report unreliable. Resource, file, and metadata columns are calculated on their corresponding task subsets.",
    "每种方法都执行同一组 150 个任务，每题计一次通过或失败，直接相加；不把耗时、全文质量或任务类别难度混成加权分。总榜适合看整体交付覆盖，具体能力仍应回到六个分榜。": "Every method runs the same 150 tasks. Each task contributes one pass or fail and the results are summed directly; latency, full-text quality, and family difficulty are not blended into a weighted score. The overall ranking shows delivery coverage, while specific capabilities belong in the six family rankings.",
    "接口正常返回次数 ÷ 全部调用次数；不代表内容正确。": "Calls with a normal interface response divided by all calls; this does not establish content correctness.",
    "满足本例全部验收规则的次数 ÷ 已测任务次数；已测任务的请求失败计入分母。未测排除且单列覆盖，不设全文 F1 门槛。": "Calls satisfying every task rule divided by measured tasks. Request failures remain in the denominator; unmeasured tasks are excluded and reported separately. There is no full-text F1 threshold for task acceptance.",
    "每例命中的必需文字组数 ÷ 登记文字组数，再按案例取均值；请求失败计 0。实际覆盖范围在表前说明。事实句、标题或说明均按组匹配；难度不同，不宜跨榜单直接比较。不是全文完整度，空核对集不计为 100%。": "Required text groups matched divided by registered groups, averaged by task; request failures score 0. Coverage scope is stated before each table. Facts, headings, and descriptions are matched by group. Difficulty varies, so values should not be compared across rankings. This is not full-text recall, and an empty check set is not treated as 100%.",
    "可判定通过或失败的调用数 ÷ 计划调用数。它是报告可靠性门槛，不是通过率或正文完整度；任何一行未满都禁止发布排名。": "Calls with a pass/fail judgement divided by planned calls. This is a report reliability gate, not pass rate or body completeness; any incomplete row blocks publication of rankings.",
    "执行者：": "Reviewer: ",
    "；模型：": "; model: ",
    "；推理强度：": "; reasoning effort: ",
    "。核验时隐藏机器结论和分数，只提供任务契约、标准答案与完整实际输出；分歧回到原始证据裁定，未决非零则禁止发布。任务和输出未变化时沿用原核验；发生变化的调用必须重新盲审。": ". Machine verdicts and scores are hidden during review; only the task contract, reference answer, and complete actual output are provided. Disagreements are adjudicated from original evidence, and any unresolved item blocks publication. Existing reviews are retained when task and output are unchanged; changed calls require a new blind review.",
    "在仓库本地 .env 配置": "Configure",
    "；报告和示例只保留占位符。": " in the repository-local .env; reports and examples retain placeholders only.",
    "完整参考覆盖 98/100；缺少参考只影响全文指标，不影响任务结果。": "Complete-reference coverage: 98/100. A missing reference affects only full-text metrics, not task acceptance. ",
    "完整参考覆盖 5/10；缺少参考只影响全文指标，不影响任务结果。": "Complete-reference coverage: 5/10. A missing reference affects only full-text metrics, not task acceptance. ",
    "完整参考覆盖 0/10；缺少参考只影响全文指标，不影响任务结果。": "Complete-reference coverage: 0/10. A missing reference affects only full-text metrics, not task acceptance. ",
    "完整参考覆盖 10/10；缺少参考只影响全文指标，不影响任务结果。": "Complete-reference coverage: 10/10. A missing reference affects only full-text metrics, not task acceptance. ",
    "文字核对范围：各方法均为 100/100 例。": "Required-text coverage: 100/100 tasks for every method. ",
    "文字核对范围：各方法均为 8/10 例。": "Required-text coverage: 8/10 tasks for every method. ",
    "文字核对范围：各方法均为 9/10 例。": "Required-text coverage: 9/10 tasks for every method. ",
    "文字核对范围：各方法均为 10/10 例。": "Required-text coverage: 10/10 tasks for every method. ",
}


